<title>JAPAN: Citizen Watch to buy back Y10 bln of its shares.</title>
<headline>Citizen Watch to buy back Y10 bln of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizen Watch Co Ltd said on Thursday it plans to buy back up to 10 billion yen worth of its own shares.</p>
<p>The watch manufacturer said in a statement that details of the share buyback would be decided at a board meeting and needs to be approved at a shareholders' meeting scheduled for June 27.</p>
</text>
